{"id":"n91205-2-7","stage":2,"title":"밀리다 · 被剃","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n91205-2-7-1","ko":"엄마, 찬물에서 조금만 놀다 올게요.","zh":"妈妈，我就在凉水里玩一会儿就回来。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"엄마,","meaning":"妈妈","explanation":"엄마：妈妈","readings":[{"term":"엄마","audio":"/audio/9498f9014908e2891f1f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67098","senseId":"1","lemma":"엄마","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"찬물에서","meaning":"冷水，冰水","explanation":"찬물：冷水，冰水；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"찬물","audio":"/audio/658c6529afb87c66be35.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71464","senseId":"1","lemma":"찬물","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"조금만","meaning":"片刻，一会儿","explanation":"조금：片刻，一会儿；만：表示“只、仅”。","readings":[{"term":"조금","audio":"/audio/b4049b7414b62d9bee5d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61176","senseId":"2","lemma":"조금","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"놀다","meaning":"玩耍，玩乐","explanation":"놀다：玩耍，玩乐；다：连接途中转换或接续的动作，具体要结合前后文。","readings":[{"term":"놀다","audio":"/audio/8fc8305f6371680eeeca.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"88353","senseId":"1","lemma":"놀다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"올게요.","meaning":"来","explanation":"오다：来；ㄹ게요：向对方礼貌地表达自己的决定或承诺。","readings":[{"term":"오다","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69514","senseId":"23","lemma":"오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"9498f9014908e289","term":"엄마","zh":"妈妈","audio":"/audio/9498f9014908e2891f1f.mp3","entryId":"67098","definition":"在非正式场合用于指称或称呼母亲。","pronunciation":["엄마"]},{"id":"658c6529afb87c66","term":"찬물","zh":"冷水，冰水","audio":"/audio/658c6529afb87c66be35.mp3","entryId":"71464","definition":"冰冷的水。","pronunciation":["찬물"]},{"id":"b4049b7414b62d9b","term":"조금","zh":"片刻，一会儿","audio":"/audio/b4049b7414b62d9bee5d.mp3","entryId":"61176","definition":"短暂时间。","pronunciation":["조금"]},{"id":"8fc8305f6371680e","term":"놀다","zh":"玩耍，玩乐","audio":"/audio/8fc8305f6371680eeeca.mp3","entryId":"88353","definition":"玩着游戏等度过有趣、愉快的时光。","pronunciation":["놀ː다"]},{"id":"6fe577b99594f4a7","term":"오다","zh":"来","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3","entryId":"69514","definition":"为了某个目的或事情而从别的地方移动到这里。","pronunciation":["오다"]}],"audio":"/audio/9dfea9186da47dc1237b.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n91205-2-7-2","ko":"지수야, 뜨거운 물에서 놀아. 그래야 때가 잘 밀리지.","zh":"智秀，你在热水里玩吧。那样污垢才容易洗掉。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"지수야,","meaning":"智秀","explanation":"지수：智秀；야：呼格助词，用来称呼关系亲近的人或晚辈。","readings":[{"term":"지수야","audio":"/audio/933aef68208bc459c4d9.mp3"}],"sources":[]},{"text":"뜨거운","meaning":"烫，热","explanation":"뜨겁다：烫，热；은：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"뜨겁다","audio":"/audio/e13d571ed55588aea4ab.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66027","senseId":"1","lemma":"뜨겁다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"물에서","meaning":"水","explanation":"물：水；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"물","audio":"/audio/2e7edc957ce601f5ff7c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17596","senseId":"1","lemma":"물","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"놀아.","meaning":"玩耍，玩乐","explanation":"놀다：玩耍，玩乐；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"놀다","audio":"/audio/8fc8305f6371680eeeca.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"88353","senseId":"1","lemma":"놀다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"그래야","meaning":"那样","explanation":"그렇다：那样；어야：表示必要条件；与 하다/되다 合用表示“应该、必须”。","readings":[{"term":"그렇다","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61178","senseId":"1","lemma":"그렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"때가","meaning":"垢，污垢","explanation":"때：垢，污垢；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"때","audio":"/audio/43bc9c47e0f938b11288.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14423","senseId":"1","lemma":"때","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"잘","meaning":"容易","explanation":"잘：容易","readings":[{"term":"잘","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58939","senseId":"14","lemma":"잘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"밀리지.","meaning":"被剃，被搓，被刨，被刮","explanation":"밀리다：被剃，被搓，被刨，被刮；지：表示确认、提醒、意愿或自问等，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"밀리다","audio":"/audio/13748c44ad5107b043c6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91205","senseId":"2","lemma":"밀리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"e13d571ed55588ae","term":"뜨겁다","zh":"烫，热","audio":"/audio/e13d571ed55588aea4ab.mp3","entryId":"66027","definition":"某物的温度高。","pronunciation":["뜨겁따"]},{"id":"2e7edc957ce601f5","term":"물","zh":"水","audio":"/audio/2e7edc957ce601f5ff7c.mp3","entryId":"17596","definition":"含在河、湖、海、地下水等，纯粹的且无色无香无味的透明液体。","pronunciation":["물"]},{"id":"8fc8305f6371680e","term":"놀다","zh":"玩耍，玩乐","audio":"/audio/8fc8305f6371680eeeca.mp3","entryId":"88353","definition":"玩着游戏等度过有趣、愉快的时光。","pronunciation":["놀ː다"]},{"id":"f7c6efa694aaef95","term":"그렇다","zh":"那样","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3","entryId":"61178","definition":"表示状态、样子、性质等与此相同。","pronunciation":["그러타"]},{"id":"43bc9c47e0f938b1","term":"때","zh":"垢，污垢","audio":"/audio/43bc9c47e0f938b11288.mp3","entryId":"14423","definition":"沾在衣服或身上的脏灰尘，或皮肤废旧细胞和灰尘混合产生的东西。","pronunciation":["때"]},{"id":"8aff11a4aebdccdb","term":"잘","zh":"容易","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3","entryId":"58939","definition":"性质或倾向较易成为某种状态或进行某种行动地。","pronunciation":["잘"]},{"id":"13748c44ad5107b0","term":"밀리다","zh":"被剃，被搓，被刨，被刮","audio":"/audio/13748c44ad5107b043c6.mp3","entryId":"91205","definition":"地板或表面不整齐的部分被涂擦掉。","pronunciation":["밀리다"]}],"audio":"/audio/5fd31a769f555856e1bc.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.587,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=91205","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"2","sourceLevel":"중급","day":81,"sequenceScore":2.2404,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["智秀，你在热水里玩吧。那样污垢才容易洗掉。","妈妈，我就在凉水里玩一会儿就回来。","你怎会在这里啊？"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["妈妈，我就在凉水里玩一会儿就回来。","你怎会在这里啊？","智秀，你在热水里玩吧。那样污垢才容易洗掉。"],"answer":2}]}
